	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11599"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=649" title="View the profile of Tirran">Tirran</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=649"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:c_lanktree@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11599#msg11599"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11599#msg11599">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #193 on:</b> October 06, 2004, 10:46:16 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&quot;While Tirran and Dajal are pretty close to accurate, they both stopped playing for quite some time/became dissinterested in the responsibilities.&quot;<br /><br /><br />what the hell are you talking about, I never stopped playing until after I disbanded from GOTM and went to AoD for a short time, Dajal did just outright stop playing, I think you are thinking of Daraf who just up and disappeared one day. I never got tired of the responsibilities until the BS Drakinn was spewing got me fed up.<br /><br /><br />&quot;I ran Guardians of the Malt for almost 6 - 7 months (Fornza/Chaffee were my new recruits before I stopped playing).. &quot;<br /><br />I personally dont recall this happening, I do remember reading both Chaffee and Fornza&#039;s apps, as I was incharge of handeling the voting process / applications that came in from the site, whoever pointed them there I dont think is very relavent :P Chaffee was one of the earlier members to join after you (the only person out of the 4 not priorly a malter), daraf, dajal and myself made the choice to reform it when we were sitting in Southern Ro, Me and Dajal later had a private meeting with Talisker over who would hold the leadership spot as we were the only two he trusted with it, we both insisted each other take it, but I made it clear Dajal had a more level head then I did.<br /><br /><br />&quot;during that time we were one of the only 3 or 4 guilds able to break Fear (AoD/AL/EK?? was a while ago), and were part of the 4 or so able to do Hate (AoD/AL/EK/HoS??). &quot;<br /><br />this also took heavy bitching and yelling from me to push the guild to realize they were capable of it, because at the time we started doing it the guild was more so back on their heels not sure if they could pull it off, when they wanted to med, so I pulled more (you should remember everyone yelling at me to slow down when really we were making amazing progress) because the monks were taking it slow and I knew our raid force could handle that.<br /><br />&quot; We killed Nagafen (sp?) numerous times and I think we dropped Vox once (all of this before kunark) in the hayday &quot; <br /><br />I was at a few Naggy kills, our first attempt was a disaster, I was at the Vox killing. we might have done her more then once when I was there.<br /><br />&quot;At one point in time I was tied for the most carmine on the server (which - was fairly by luck because GoTM started doing fear just after they switched from the single caster gear (blanking on it&#039;s name) to individual class gear.&quot;&quot;<br /><br /><br />yeah i remember you swearing and bitching cause the Salmapus got the Carmine robe instead of you cause you were away on Vacation (It dropped about 15 minutes before you got home and logged on.<br /><br /><br /><br />&quot;I was still &quot;leader&quot; for quite some time into Kunark&quot;<br /><br />Again, I dont recall&nbsp; you ever being in the officall, or assumed, leader position, when Dajal left Chaffee took up the reigns without the title aspect of it, later down the road we managed to get Dajal to log on and transfer leadership to him (I again didnt want it)<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: October 06, 2004, 11:04:34 am by Tirran</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
